,$ and it occurs at $x=2.$\n\n- The smallest output is $-8,$ and it occurs at $x=4.$\n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =10 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =2 \\\\ {min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =-8 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x) & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8a466fba-def7-55ba-8f8f-e4d5b58d8d7b" "answer-field-bbb2ab49-40eb-5b48-800d-507bb695f316" "answer-field-a8adcb23-4793-5db2-b42b-3165ad50dc81" "answer-field-f5f2cbab-fe79-531d-989d-eb0bd6dc2ed9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8a466fba-def7-55ba-8f8f-e4d5b58d8d7b" :answer-field/id #uuid "8a466fba-def7-55ba-8f8f-e4d5b58d8d7b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-a7788327-b0c0-54fc-85c0-8f6bfa719642" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a7788327-b0c0-54fc-85c0-8f6bfa719642"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a7788327-b0c0-54fc-85c0-8f6bfa719642" :answer/id #uuid "a7788327-b0c0-54fc-85c0-8f6bfa719642" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-bbb2ab49-40eb-5b48-800d-507bb695f316" :answer-field/id #uuid "bbb2ab49-40eb-5b48-800d-507bb695f316" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-f0cae313-5ca8-5968-99a4-e1333c64e33e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f0cae313-5ca8-5968-99a4-e1333c64e33e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f0cae313-5ca8-5968-99a4-e1333c64e33e" :answer/id #uuid "f0cae313-5ca8-5968-99a4-e1333c64e33e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a8adcb23-4793-5db2-b42b-3165ad50dc81" :answer-field/id #uuid "a8adcb23-4793-5db2-b42b-3165ad50dc81" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-73cb411d-4a6d-5b99-97f