type/math :answer/value "\\{1,7\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7bb97192-6919-5a96-9a3f-09daee560845" :answer/id #uuid "7bb97192-6919-5a96-9a3f-09daee560845" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{3\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-766090e8-7730-5324-a88a-78fc608aa33f" :answer/id #uuid "766090e8-7730-5324-a88a-78fc608aa33f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{5\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186231735 :question/problem "Let $T=\\{-2,-1,0,1\\}$ and suppose\n\n$$\ng(-2)=3,\\,g(-1)=-2,\\,g(0)=0,\\,g(1)=-2.\n$$\n\nCompute ${min}_{x\\in T}g(x)$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}g(x).$\n\n$\\,$\n${min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${min}_{x\\in T}f(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}f(x)$ is an input in $T$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $3,$ $-2,$ $0,$ and $-2,$ so the minimum output value is $-2.$ This minimum occurs at both $x=-1$ and $x=1.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=-2\\,\\text{and}\\,\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in T}g(x)=\\{-1,1\\}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186231003 :answer-field/correct 17592186231007 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 17592186230997 :answer-field/correct "answer-fb3b48b6-7d47-5ae4-9b29-ebd354c5d29a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fb3b48b6-7d47-5ae4-9b29-ebd354c5d29a" "answer-c323b06b-7a3b-51b1-b940-61dbb9aca334" "answer-71a394aa-8e3b-524c-8e76-c656e0db6806" "answer-890abc9b-4b54-5ee2-9413-30a0aa7c2a70" "answer-31464fc0-268d-513c-a882-b9f9b02a994e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fb3b48b6-7d47-5ae4-9b29-ebd354c5d29a" :answer/id #uuid "fb3b48b6-7d47-5ae4-9b29-ebd354c5d29a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-1,1\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c323b06b-7a3b-51b1-b940-61dbb9aca334" :answer/id #uuid "c323b06b-7a3b-51b1-b940-61dbb9aca334" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-1\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-71a394aa-8e3b-524c-8e76-c656e0db6806" :answer/id #uuid "71a394aa-8e3b-524c-8e76-c656e0db6806" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-2,0\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-890abc9b-4b54-5ee2-9413-30a0aa7c2a70" :answer/id #uuid "890abc9b-4b54-5ee2-9413-30a0aa7c2a70" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{-2\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-31464fc0-268d-513c-a882-b9f9b02a994e" :answer/id #uuid "31464fc0-268d-513c-a882-b9f9b02a994e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{1\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-53479689-99f5-53fc-9bbf-170474b20c8c" :question/id #uuid "53479689-99f5-53fc-9bbf-170474b20c8c" :question/math-academy-id "q-355387" :question/problem "Let $B=\\{-4,-2,0,3\\}$ and suppose\n\n$$\nk(-4)=-5,\\,k(-2)=-8,\\,k(0)=-2,\\,k(3)=-8.\n$$\n\nCompute ${min}_{x\\in B}k(x)$ and $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in B}k(x).$\n\n$\\,$\n${min}_{x\\in B}k(x)=$ {{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in B}k(x)=$ {{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${min}_{x\\in B}k(x)$ is the smallest output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in B}k(x)$ is an input in $B$ where that smallest output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $-5,$ $-8,$ $-2,$ and $-8,$ so the minimum output value is $-8.$ This minimum occurs at both $x=-2$ and $x=3.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{min}_{x\\in B}k(x)=-8\\,\\text{and}\\,\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in B}k(x)=\\{-2,3\\}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-98216f74-dc70-5d6d-8b65-3533eb892def" "answer-field-cf2478ca-341b-5684-917e-23c1fbc33ba5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-98216f74-dc70-5d6d-8b65-3533eb892def" :answer-field/id #uuid "98216f74-dc70-5d6d-8