-1$ |\n| $0$ | $-3$ |\n| $3$ | $2$ |\n| $5$ | $4$ |\n\nThe table above gives values of a function $h$ on the set $T=\\{-4,-2,0,3,5\\}.$ Compute the following:\n\n${max}_{t\\in T}h(t)=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}h(t)=$\n{{field-2}}\n\n${min}_{t\\in T}h(t)=$\n{{field-3}}\n\n$\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}h(t)=$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Recall that \n\n- ${max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the maximum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that maximum output occurs.\n\nOn the other hand,\n\n- ${min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is the minimum output value, while\n\n- $\\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{x\\in S}f(x)$ is an input in $S$ where that minimum output occurs.\n\nThe output values are $5,-1,-3,2,$ and $4.$ The maximum output is $5$ (at $t=-4$), and the minimum output is $-3$ (at $t=0$). \n\nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{max}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =5 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{max}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =-4 \\\\ {min}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =-3 \\\\ \\operatorname{arg}⁡{min}_{t\\in T}h(t) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" "answer-field-1e00f5be-3d45-51a7-8749-7d495f6cdca7" "answer-field-33caca9d-1372-58e9-a4ff-a1e38fc0dee1" "answer-field-f2f7a01d-04e9-5668-a3bc-13c57aa6f398"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/id #uuid "5add7f78-978a-512e-aef3-6c382ab2be06" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer/id #uuid "66c7e82e-c220-5e51-a89e-ba9b54a5c39a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fie